aeroplane: “An aeroplane is a large metallic aircraft with wide wings, a long cylindrical body, and a tall vertical tail fin, usually silver, white, or gray in color with reflective surfaces and dark-tinted windows.”
bicycle: “A bicycle is a slender two-wheeled vehicle with thin rubber tires, metal spokes, and a triangular frame, often painted red, blue, or silver with a visible chain and curved handlebars.”
